<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">半生冷眼静坐席间</text><text for="L2">看那些天之骄子安居童话幻境</text><text for="L3">容貌 气运 锦衣玉食 从无求而不得之憾</text><text for="L4">而如今正是挺身请愿的时刻</text><text for="L5">这一生我都在冷眼旁观</text><text for="L6">看那些宠儿耽于虚妄神话</text><text for="L7">皮囊 侥幸 堆金积玉 从未尝过匮乏与企求</text><text for="L8">此刻终当奋起抗辩 敲响战鼓</text><text for="L9">只因我心中长存疑惑</text><text for="L10">你何时才能看清我绝非待价而沽</text><text for="L11">我始终在厉声叩问</text><text for="L12">你何时才能明白我绝不做你机器里的齿轮</text><text for="L13">绝不做任由你驱使的零件</text><text for="L14">我毫不畏惧你口中的威吓说教</text><text for="L15">更不惧怕深渊腹地盘踞的巨兽</text><text for="L16">将我杯中倾满无止境的野心</text><text for="L17">按我胸中宏图为这整座城池着色</text><text for="L18">我何曾惧怕你所谓的训诫</text><text for="L19">又何曾畏缩于体制牢笼里的猛兽</text><text for="L20">以吞吐天地的抱负斟满酒杯</text><text for="L21">将整片天地染上独属于我的色彩</text><text for="L22">我一次次在心头思索</text><text for="L23">你究竟何时才懂我的灵魂千金不换</text><text for="L24">我不断发起质疑</text><text for="L25">你究竟何时才醒悟我绝非你体制的附庸</text><text for="L26">绝不受你的巨型机器摆布</text><text for="L27">我自成天地 执掌乾坤</text><text for="L28">我才是主宰自身命运的机器</text><text for="L29">只因我一直想知道</text><text for="L30">你何时才能懂得我不可收买</text><text for="L31">我久久地追问</text><text for="L32">你何时才能看清我绝不充当你的驯服工具</text><text for="L33">绝不作这冰冷机器的部件</text><text for="L34">我始终在困惑</text><text for="L35">你何时才能明白尊严无价</text><text for="L36">我决绝地质问</text><text for="L37">你何时才能认清我绝不沦为你流水线上的玩偶</text><text for="L38">绝不入你的囚笼机巧</text><text for="L39">我才是奔涌不息的狂暴巨力</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="source"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Machine"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Imagine Dragons"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Origins (Deluxe)"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Origins"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM71816159"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1437948983"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:12.286" end="2:58.281"><p begin="0:12.286" end="0:15.056" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:12.286" end="0:12.406">All</span> <span begin="0:12.406" end="0:12.766">my</span> <span begin="0:12.766" end="0:13.166">life</span> <span begin="0:13.166" end="0:13.346">been</span> <span begin="0:13.346" end="0:13.786">sit</span><span begin="0:13.786" end="0:13.976">tin'</span> <span begin="0:13.976" end="0:14.146">at</span> <span begin="0:14.146" end="0:14.276">the</span> <span begin="0:14.276" end="0:14.546">ta</span><span begin="0:14.546" end="0:15.056">ble</span></p><p begin="0:15.056" end="0:17.936" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:15.056" end="0:15.386">Watch</span><span begin="0:15.386" end="0:15.476">in'</span> <span begin="0:15.476" end="0:15.736">them</span> <span begin="0:15.736" end="0:16.356">kids</span> <span begin="0:16.356" end="0:16.686">they're</span> <span begin="0:16.686" end="0:16.816">liv</span><span begin="0:16.816" end="0:16.926">ing</span> <span begin="0:16.926" end="0:17.166">in</span> <span begin="0:17.166" end="0:17.216">a</span> <span begin="0:17.216" end="0:17.546">fa</span><span begin="0:17.546" end="0:17.936">ble</span></p><p begin="0:17.942" end="0:20.852" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.942" end="0:18.402">Looks</span> <span begin="0:18.402" end="0:18.682">luck</span> <span begin="0:18.682" end="0:19.032">mon</span><span begin="0:19.032" end="0:19.172">ey</span> <span begin="0:19.172" end="0:19.372">and</span> <span begin="0:19.372" end="0:19.702">nev</span><span begin="0:19.702" end="0:19.772">er</span> <span begin="0:19.772" end="0:20.142">left</span> <span begin="0:20.142" end="0:20.212">a'</span><span begin="0:20.212" end="0:20.572">wish</span><span begin="0:20.572